shàng chī suān nǎi ","I ate yoghurt this morning.","tatoeba:6284431"],["牛奶酸了。","niú nǎi suān le ","The milk is sour.","tatoeba:3140026"],["我喜欢酸菜。","wǒ xǐ huan suān cài ","I like sauerkraut.","tatoeba:10358807"]],"苦":[["我知道你有痛苦。","wǒ zhī dào nǐ yǒu tòng kǔ ","I know you're suffering.","tatoeba:8860577"],["他比您更刻苦。","tā bǐ nín gèng kè kǔ ","He's even more hardworking than you are.","tatoeba:2353494"],["良药苦口。","liáng yào kǔ kǒu ","Good medicine is bitter to the mouth.","tatoeba:728686"]],"辣":[["不是很辣。","bú shì hěn là ","It's not very spicy.","tatoeba:686984"],["我不吃辣。","wǒ bù chī là ","I don't eat spicy food.","tatoeba:737101"],["辣点儿没关系。","là diǎn r méi guān xì ","I don't mind if it's hot.","tatoeba:1438343"]],"碗":[["我们有几个碗？","wǒ men yǒu jǐ gè wǎn ","How many bowls do we have?","tatoeba:1490482"],["一个木头碗。","yí gè mù tou wǎn ","A wooden bowl.","tatoeba:2915620"],["这女生不喜欢洗碗。","zhè nǚ shēng bù xǐ huan xǐ wǎn ","The girl doesn't like washing the dishes.","tatoeba:808857"]]}
